Adds benchmark/export tooling plus validator disk cleanup controls.

Key changes:
- New SWE-bench, Terminal-Bench, and fast king-eval daemons with fixtures, agents, start scripts, and tests.
- Task-only Hugging Face export command.
- Validator/pool-manager disk headroom cleanup for old validate task dirs.
- Optional cleanup of uploaded, inactive rollout task dirs.
- Immediate archived task deletion after successful HF upload, with retry on failure or lease protection.
- Private-submission queue wakeup marker so accepted private submissions can wake validation early.
- Shorter queued pool-gate sleeps, best-effort Docker cleanup, normalized swebench-local R2 payload, and reduced diff-judge prompt-injection false positives.

